4	 * Thrown by
5	 * {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner.CheckOwnerIdentityUnique} when the
6	 * owner being created has the same derived {@code identityKey} (normalizedTelephone + '|' + email +
7	 * '|' + householdId) as an existing owner. This single check replaces the former separate telephone,
